# AI Girlfriend Frontend Master Guide
**Stack**: Bun + Next.js (App Router) + RainbowKit + Wagmi + TanStack Query + Socket.io + Tailwind CSS

This guide provides a "Copy-Paste" blueprint to build a **Responsive, Telegram-style** application.

---

## 1. App Flow & Architecture

### User Journey
1.  **Connect Wallet**: User lands on Login/Home screen. Connects Wallet (Monad Testnet).
2.  **Auto-Auth**: App signs a message transparently to authenticate with Backend.
3.  **Onboarding (Mobile First)**:
    *   **Mobile**: Bottom Navigation Bar (Chat, Wallet, Profile).
    *   **Desktop**: Left Sidebar (Telegram Web style).
4.  **Chat (Telegram Style)**:
    *   Real-time streaming text.
    *   Bubbles with "read" status.
    *   Sticky input bar with send button.
5.  **Token System**:
    *   Real-time balance updates via WebSocket.
    *   "Low Balance" triggers a beautiful deposit modal.

---

## 2. Project Setup

### Initialization
```bash
bun create next-app my-bini-frontend
# Select: TS, Tailwind, ESLint, App Router, No Src
cd my-bini-frontend
```

### Install Dependencies
```bash
# Web3 & State
bun add @rainbow-me/rainbowkit wagmi viem @tanstack/react-query socket.io-client

# UI & Animation
bun add clsx tailwind-merge framer-motion lucide-react sonner
```

---

## 3. Global Styles (`app/globals.css`)

Telegram Dark Mode inspired.

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;

:root {
  --tg-bg: #0f172a;       /* Dark Blue/Slate */
  --tg-secondary: #1e293b; 
  --tg-bubble-in: #1e293b;
  --tg-bubble-out: #3b82f6; /* Blue 500 */
  --tg-text: #f8fafc;
  --tg-hint: #94a3b8;
}

body {
  background-color: var(--tg-bg);
  color: var(--tg-text);
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  overflow: hidden; /* Prevent body scroll, handle inside layout */
}

/* Telegram-like Custom Scrollbar */
::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 6px;
}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
  background: transparent; 
}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); 
  border-radius: 3px;
}
```

